@baseUrl = http://localhost:1198
@token = paste-login-token-here

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hello

### Login with a demo account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "user1@mail.com",
    "password": "password1"
}

### Search TVMaze shows
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/search?title=sunday
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
